  <entry>
    <id>tag:github.com,2008:Repository/658928958/v0.40.5-rc1</id>
    <updated>2026-10-15T14:28:26Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://github.com/ollama/ollama/releases/tag/v0.40.5-rc1"/>
    <title>v0.40.5-rc1: New model... (#19030)</title>
    <content type="html">&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;ci: shorten Windows Vulkan build path&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Keep the nested shader-generator compiler probes below Windows path limits in checkouts with longer repository names.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;mlx: fix Nemotron bugs and support global scales&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Accept published Nemotron layer names while retaining legacy aliases, and&lt;br&gt;
fix layer-count inference and detached MTP quantization. Stabilize Mamba&lt;br&gt;
softplus, preserve FP32 vision normalization, and compile Mamba gate and&lt;br&gt;
norm scaling.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Support per-expert F32 global scales and preserve activation-scale&lt;br&gt;
companions in ModelOpt and compressed-tensors NVFP4 imports. Normalize&lt;br&gt;
reciprocal globals and reject invalid scales. Keep activation scales&lt;br&gt;
separate from weight-only inference.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;mlx: add Nemotron 3.5 Super&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;minor adjustments&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</content>
    <author>
      <name>dhiltgen</name>
    </author>
    <media:thumbnail height="30" width="30" url="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4033016?s=60&amp;v=4"/>
