  <entry>
    <id>tag:github.com,2008:Repository/658928958/v0.40.4</id>
    <updated>2026-10-14T02:23:26Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://github.com/ollama/ollama/releases/tag/v0.40.4"/>
    <title>v0.40.4</title>
    <content type="html">&lt;h2&gt;Decision models in the CLI&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Decision models can now be used directly from the terminal with &lt;code&gt;ollama run&lt;/code&gt; — ask yes/no questions, classify text into labels, or score against a rubric:&lt;br&gt;
&lt;code&gt;ollama run nimble --ask &quot;Is a refund being requested?&quot; &amp;lt; ticket.txt&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What&#39;s Changed&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Kev decision models are now supported by the MLX runner on Apple silicon&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;ollama launch&lt;/code&gt; can now be used with usage credits without upgrading to a paid plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;ollama launch codex&lt;/code&gt; now includes locally installed Ollama models in its model picker. Use &lt;code&gt;/model&lt;/code&gt; within the Codex CLI to swap models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improved inference performance by reusing verified manifests and already loaded models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Added support for multimodal embeddings through llama-server&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed loading multimodal embedding models with small context windows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improved Gemma 4 prefill performance on NVIDIA GPUs with the MLX runner&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;MLX runner now clips long Laya states instead of rejecting them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improved speculative decoding reliability in the MLX runner, including recurrent state handling after rollback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Updated llama.cpp with native decision model support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Updated README and documentation with clearer privacy and cloud-services wording&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full Changelog&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;a class=&quot;commit-link&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ollama/ollama/compare/v0.40.3...v0.40.4&quot;&gt;&lt;tt&gt;v0.40.3...v0.40.4&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</content>
